"max_width":"narrow","alignment":"left","type_preset":"rte","font":"var(--font-body--family)","font_size":"1rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color":"var(--color-foreground)","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}},"accordion_JF3ggD":{"type":"accordion","name":"t:names.accordion","settings":{"icon":"caret","dividers":true,"type_preset":"h5","inherit_color_scheme":true,"color_scheme":"","border":"none","border_width":1,"border_opacity":100,"border_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{"accordion_row_J79KHr":{"type":"_accordion-row","settings":{"heading":"Kan jeg bestille som virksomhed eller til et arrangement?","open_by_default":false,"icon":"none","width":20},"blocks":{"text_Q3La6e":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Ja, vi tilbyder gerne større ordrer til virksomheder og arrangementer. Kontakt os direkte, så finder vi en løsning, der passer til jeres behov — herunder eventuelle mængderabatter.<\/p>","width":"100%","max_width":"normal","alignment":"left","type_preset":"custom","font":"var(--font-body--family)","font_size":"0.875rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color":"var(--color-foreground)","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["text_Q3La6e"]},"accordion_row_CKpAtG":{"type":"_accordion-row","settings":{"heading":"Hvilke betalingsmetoder accepterer I?","open_by_default":false,"icon":"none","width":20},"blocks":{"text_xWtMFa":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Vi accepterer betaling med Dankort, Visa, Mastercard og MobilePay. Alle transaktioner foregår via en sikker, krypteret forbindelse.<\/p>","width":"100%","max_width":"normal","alignment":"left","type_preset":"custom","font":"var(--font-body--family)","font_size":"0.875rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color":"var(--color-foreground)","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["text_xWtMFa"]},"accordion_row_RXAmtF":{"type":"_accordion-row","settings":{"heading":"Hvordan foregår aldersverificeringen?","open_by_default":false,"icon":"none","width":20},"blocks":{"text_WFEdCb":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Vi benytter MitID til at verificere din alder, når du handler hos os. Du vil blive bedt om at logge ind med MitID i forbindelse med din bestilling. Processen er hurtig, sikker og i overensstemmelse med gældende lovkrav. Vi gemmer ikke dine MitID-loginoplysninger. Dine data behandles i overensstemmelse med GDPR og vores privatlivspolitik<\/p>","width":"100%","max_width":"normal","alignment":"left","type_preset":"custom","font":"var(--font-body--family)","font_size":"0.875rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color":"var(--color-foreground)","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["text_WFEdCb"]},"accordion_row_dDHkDe":{"type":"_accordion-row","settings":{"heading":"Kan jeg ændre eller annullere min ordre?","open_by_default":false,"icon":"none","width":20},"blocks":{"text_BKFHqw":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Hvis du ønsker at ændre eller annullere din ordre, skal du kontakte os hurtigst muligt via e-mail eller telefon, kontakt os <a href=\"\/pages\/kontakt\" title=\"Kontakt\">her.<\/a> Når ordren er afsendt, kan vi desværre ikke længere ændre den.<\/p>","width":"100%","max_width":"normal","alignment":"left","type_preset":"custom","font":"var(--font-body--family)","font_size":"0.875rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color":"var(--color-foreground)","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["text_BKFHqw"]},"accordion_row_N7QbQn":{"type":"_accordion-row","settings":{"heading":"Kan jeg returnere mine varer?","open_by_default":false,"icon":"none","width":20},"blocks":{"text_4UmkF6":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Som forbruger har du 14 dages fortrydelsesret fra den dag, du modtager din ordre, jf. forbrugeraftalelovens bestemmelser. Fortrydelsesretten gælder for uåbnede varer i original, ubeskadiget emballage. Modtager du en vare der er fejlbehæftet eller beskadiget under transport, kontakter du os <a href=\"\/pages\/kontakt\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Kontakt\">her.<\/a><\/p>","width":"100%","max_width":"normal","alignment":"left","type_preset":"custom","font":"var(--font-body--family)","font_size":"0.875rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color":"var(--color-foreground)","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["text_4UmkF6"]},"accordion_row_7XbcXn":{"type":"_accordion-row","settings":{"heading":"Kan I pakke min ordre som gave?","open_by_default":false,"icon":"none","width":20},"blocks":{"text_DwiBGM":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Ja, vi tilbyder gaveindpakning mod et mindre tillæg. Du kan tilføje gaveindpakning under bestillingsprocessen og eventuelt vedhæfte en personlig hilsen.<\/p>","width":"100%","max_width":"normal","alignment":"left","type_preset":"custom","font":"var(--font-body--family)","font_size":"0.875rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color":"var(--color-foreground)","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["text_DwiBGM"]},"accordion_row_x7i9nT":{"type":"_accordion-row","settings":{"heading":"Hvordan kontakter jeg Fjord?","open_by_default":false,"icon":"none","width":20},"blocks":{"text_nckKgy":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Du kan kontakte os via e-mail på info@fjord-bryg.dk, via telefon i vores åbningstider eller gennem dette <a href=\"\/pages\/kontakt\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Kontakt\"><strong>link<\/strong><\/a>. Du finder vores kontaktoplysninger på kontaktsiden. Vi bestræber os på at besvare alle henvendelser inden for 24 timer på hverdage.<\/p>","width":"100%","max_width":"normal","alignment":"left","type_preset":"custom","font":"var(--font-body--family)","font_size":"0.875rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color":"var(--color-foreground)","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["text_nckKgy"]},"accordion_row_zXEgik":{"type":"_accordion-row","settings":{"heading":"Sælger I gavekort?","open_by_default":false,"icon":"none","width":20},"blocks":{"text_LU4bgB":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Ja, vi tilbyder digitale gavekort, som kan købes direkte på webshoppen. Gavekortet sendes til modtagerens e-mailadresse og kan bruges på alle produkter i vores sortiment.<\/p>","width":"100%","max_width":"normal","alignment":"left","type_preset":"custom","font":"var(--font-body--family)","font_size":"0.875rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color":"var(--color-foreground)","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-st